<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16954" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀταξία</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιη,</span>
		ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>indiscipline,</i> prop. among soldiers, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐταξία,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.92
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				3.1.9
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			generally, <i>disorder, confusion,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. καὶ ἀκολασία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Cri.</u>
					53d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμαθία καὶ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Ath.</u>
					1.5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. καὶ ἀναρχία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1302b28
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τάξιν ἤγαγεν ἐκ τῆς ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					30a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ τύχης καὶ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>PA</u>
					641b23
				</span></i>
			: in pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀταξιῶν,</span> opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἐν ταῖς κινήσεσι τάξεων,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				653e
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαίτης ἀ.</span>”
				<i>irregularity,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Coac.</u>
					211
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόμων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					3.38
				</span></i>
			.</div>
